      "id": "home-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "w": 900,
      "text": "Homepage designed for the LIVE game (December 2026 onward), not the announcement window.\n\nSlots, top to bottom: search \u00b7 This week (reset, raid tier, active event, latest hotfix, realm status) \u00b7 tools \u00b7 What changed (hotfix / datamined / community / this site, each tagged) \u00b7 Your characters (signed in: raid lockouts, attunements, zone quests, Legacy progress, fed by the addon) \u00b7 guides by class \u00b7 guilds recruiting \u00b7 recent contributions.\n\nPre-launch, the same slots hold dates, 'still unknown', and 'add a character' prompts. Live data shown here is marked Sample; bracketed values are placeholders.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "home-mobile",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -120,
